        <item>
            <title>0.2.6</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 18:54:33 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/cobaltdisco/torrid-releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>12</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>New</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Redesigned browser window, with a sidebar listing every video on the page.</li>
  <li>Built-in ad blocking, with filter lists that update automatically.</li>
  <li>Clear the browser's cache or website data in Settings › Browser.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Improved</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Streaming videos download much faster.</li>
  <li>Torrent contents are grouped by folder.</li>
  <li>Video downloads recover from stalls, and the speed display is steadier.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Fixed</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Command-C copies text in the built-in browser.</li>
  <li>Browser windows no longer reopen when Torrid launches.</li>
  <li>Pages that try to open another app no longer show an error.</li>
  <li>Many other fixes.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
